Short version: V0234__add_idempotency_keys.sql attempted to backfill 12M rows
in billing_transactions and was blocked indefinitely by a concurrent process
on the analytics replica. Our migration eventually exhausted the connection
pool.

Recommended remediation areas (details on the voicemail):
- Tighten the relevant session-level migration settings (see voicemail).
- Add a pre-migration pause step for the upstream pipeline to all runbooks.
- Update Terraform aws_db_parameter_group to enforce
  log_min_duration_statement=500ms across all RDS instances.

